# What NOT to publish to npm.
#
# Important: npm falls back to .gitignore when no .npmignore exists. Our .gitignore
# ignores dist/, which would silently drop the compiled binaries from the tarball.
# This file therefore overrides it and keeps dist/ included.
#
# Only the launcher, the binaries, the docs and the license are shipped; the Go
# sources, design docs and scripts stay out of the package.

docs/
internal/
scripts/
main.go
go.mod
AGENTS.md
RULES.md
.gitignore
.codebuddy/
.claude/
.trae/
!dist/
